/ Disabled stand-in for the Pay button when a pre-check blocks renewal. The
/ reason IS the label (stolen flag in red, or not enough poptabs in muted), so a
/ blocked card adds no height and the message is visible on touch without a
/ tooltip.
/ locals: label, tone
button.btn.btn-sm.w-100[class="btn-#{tone}" type="button" disabled]
  i.bi.bi-lock-fill.me-1
  = label
